
         
         <p>I designed the basis of this theme during a live stream earlier today:
<a href="https://protesilaos.com/codelog/2026-10-31-emacs-live-ef-themes-halloween/">https://protesilaos.com/codelog/2026-10-31-emacs-live-ef-themes-halloween/</a>.
Then I followed it up with refinements to colour values and palette
mappings. The light counterpart of this theme will be the subject of
further development work, maybe tomorrow or next week.</p>

<p>When I include “light” or “dark” in the theme’s name, it means that I
have envisaged it as part of a pair. Most themes are not designed as
pairs though, as certain colours cannot work in both cases.</p>

<p>Always <strong>click to enlarge the image</strong> for best results.</p>

